<div class="modal-backdrop" data-modal-backdrop><section class="modal-panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="label-printer-delete-title"><div class="modal-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">Label Printing</p><h2 id="label-printer-delete-title">Remove Printer</h2></div><button type="button" class="modal-close-button" data-modal-close aria-label="Close modal">×</button></div><div class="modal-body"><p>Remove <strong><%= printer.display_name %></strong> from the active printer registry?</p><p class="field-hint">Group memberships are removed automatically. Existing print-history snapshots remain readable.</p><form method="post" action="<%= management ? '/management/printers' : '/tech/printers' %>/<%= printer.label_printer_id %>/delete" hx-post="<%= management ? '/management/printers' : '/tech/printers' %>/<%= printer.label_printer_id %>/delete" hx-target="#modal-root" hx-swap="innerHTML"><div class="form-actions"><button class="primary-button danger-button" type="submit">Remove Printer</button><button class="secondary-button" type="button" data-modal-close>Cancel</button></div></form></div></section></div>
